{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786999215377641001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"superior-pinelike-garpike","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"e4e964bb4398e5e2e97a8f24ba44d5c093780ff172a0bcf920760d7396f10865","event_uuid":"f10e7bd9-337a-4c0e-b56d-cfae4db1e346","position":{"commit_sha":"eadb460f7874a85ab10deb9c06643a5a13cfd7ec","position":"1786994077943346001-f10e7bd9-337a-4c0e-b56d-cfae4db1e346"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"db7735b9fa555ad2687477c50c31b8b9c89ce229722deb4102d51b49c3d9d47a","event_uuid":"82b3bd04-9ad4-42ac-b9e3-dead04b92a70","position":{"commit_sha":"0de10cb60aa3354e62e81995562b1fcc59631fb6","position":"1786994129656288001-82b3bd04-9ad4-42ac-b9e3-dead04b92a70"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"5904afd9c412b4714cd8e0707946d5c6de73d99964d27643950ce20eec18742b","event_uuid":"5da658d4-dea9-4196-840e-9b5731508ea4","position":{"commit_sha":"cafedd859c9ef5d9b1fae8b5ad0fc1009ec3d98a","position":"1786994138707046001-5da658d4-dea9-4196-840e-9b5731508ea4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786994077943346001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"82b3bd04-9ad4-42ac-b9e3-dead04b92a70","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b783-16ee-9520-4dda"},{"link_uuid":"5da658d4-dea9-4196-840e-9b5731508ea4","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"368f-f03e-a045-4377"}],"description":"## Summary\nThe scheduled **Live External Integration** run on 2026-08-17 (run 32000764439, job \"jira DC harness smoke (real Jira Data Center, ephemeral)\") failed\n`tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_multi_project_rehearsal.py::test_unknown_project_fails_closed`\nwith:\n\n```\nE   Failed: DID NOT RAISE RebarError\n```\n\nThe scenario maps an unknown project key — `rebar.bridge_projects_set(unknown, [\"rebar-ghost\"], repo_root=str(work))` — and then previews/syncs it, expecting the bridge to **fail closed** (RAISE `RebarError`) rather than silently no-op on an unknown mapped key. Against the live DC instance it did **not** raise.\n\n## Regression window\nThis is a NEW regression, not a long-standing failure:\n- 2026-08-15 run 31879125045 (jira DC job 94999114642): **73 passed, 1 xfailed, 0 failed**.\n- 2026-08-17 run 32000764439: **2 failed, 71 passed, 1 xfailed** — this test is one of the two new failures.\n\nSo a change landed between 2026-08-15 and 2026-08-17 that broke the fail-closed guard for an unknown bridge-project key. Candidate areas to bisect: `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/projects_store.py` (`resolve_project` / `compute_snapshot`), `bridge_projects_set`, and the multi-project preview/sync path (cf. related bug 3b87 `resolve_project` tri-state collapse, and epic 0e68 / story 368f which delivered this behavior).\n\n## Impact\nThe multi-project bridge's fail-closed safety guarantee is not holding against a real Jira DC instance: an unknown mapped project key produces a silent empty fetch/sync instead of an error. Correctness/safety of the many-to-many bridge.\n\n## The regression escaped because only a LIVE test covered it\nPer triage guidance: a live-external regression must be reproducible by a NON-external test so CI catches it without the (slow, credentialed) live suite. Today the only coverage is the live DC rehearsal.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A **RED** non-external test (unit or fake-transport integration, no live DC/creds) reproduces the regression: setting an unknown bridge-project mapping and running preview/sync RAISES `RebarError` (fail-closed) — asserted to FAIL against current `main` before the fix.\n- [ ] Root cause identified (the change between 2026-08-15 and 2026-08-17 that dropped the fail-closed behavior) and fixed so an unknown mapped project key fails closed.\n- [ ] The new non-external test passes after the fix.\n- [ ] The live rehearsal `test_unknown_project_fails_closed` passes in the next Live External Integration run.\n\n## Evidence\n- Failing run: https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/32000764439 (job: jira DC harness smoke)\n- Test: `tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_multi_project_rehearsal.py::test_unknown_project_fails_closed`\n- Delivered by story 368f (gasolinic-microbian-puffin), epic 0e68 (outrageous-uncultured-wildebeast).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","368f-f03e-a045-4377"],["relates_to","b783-16ee-9520-4dda"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f643-db7d-3d9c-4bd3","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live Jira DC rehearsal: unknown bridge project no longer fails closed (test_unknown_project_fails_closed — DID NOT RAISE RebarError)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f10e7bd9-337a-4c0e-b56d-cfae4db1e346","82b3bd04-9ad4-42ac-b9e3-dead04b92a70","5da658d4-dea9-4196-840e-9b5731508ea4"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786999215377641001,"uuid":"294f9a5a-69c6-4e43-b316-2d0f77e7a3a4"}